pe-2560x1440.png", "id": "2885446691827698", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/748811223_2885446695161031_7017781235650755011_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2bEK7-gUvUQ7kNvwHPGtf-&_nc_oc=Adoep3-Pt3oREs59Vm_4X12O6ALsemgr2g_nvp4OUudDcv_xh16Qx833DyCNdGAX2fI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV9tbE42hDcOQUkB-lUpSf5A8g8q0tHGELOWkTeVCgPpw&oe=6B10385D"}, "display_name": "Casino Getaway", "keywords": ["casino", "blackjack", "slots", "poker", "roulette"], "long_description": "Pack nothing. Go anywhere. The table's waiting.\n\nPlay blackjack by the fire while snow falls outside. Throw dice on a riverboat under a full moon. Spin roulette under a glass dome with a whole planet turning below you.\n\nCasino Getaway is your own private casino. No strangers at your elbow, no one waiting for your seat, no rush. Sit down wherever you like and play at your own pace for as long as you please.\n\nThirteen games, all yours\n- Blackjack, Baccarat, Roulette and Craps\n- Beat the House Hold'em, Beat the House 3 Card, Biloxi Stud, Bahama Stud and Casino Over Under\n- Lucky 7s, Wheel of Gold and Ember Dragon slot machines\n- Video Poker\n\nIt feels like being there\nPick up the dice and throw them with your own arm. Slide your chips onto the felt. Pull the lever. Lift your cards. Your own dealer deals to you, and nobody else.\n\nNever played? Good.\nEvery game has a short lesson on the table and a hint button that tells you the smart play and why.\n\nClimb to Diamond\nYour membership card remembers your play. Reach your goals, collect your rewards and work your way from Bronze to Diamond.\n\nSix places to play\nThe Classic Casino comes with the game. Five more getaways are sold separately: Riverboat, Mountain Lodge, Night Train, Penthouse and Space Station.\n\nJust for fun\nYou play with chips that have no cash value. They can't be bought, sold or cashed out. So relax and put your feet up.\n\nSingle player. Play seated or standing.", "short_description": "Your own private casino, anywhere you fancy. No crowd, no queue, no rush: just you, the dealer and thirteen games."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wmdentertainment.com/privacy/casino-getaway", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "WMD Entertainment LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://wmdentertainment.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1431005616758685"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1108546821807372"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1593334129206593"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2343010879824010"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2343010879824010"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1108546821807372"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1450255364833710", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "2308258929936191", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1380642228461691", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typena